WEBVTT

00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:07.180
<i>Long ago, the legend says,</i>
很久以前，传说

00:00:07.220 --> 00:00:08.421
<i>Chang’e flew to the Moon.</i>
嫦娥飞上了月亮。

00:00:08.461 --> 00:00:10.141
<i>Unable to return home.</i>
回不了家。

00:00:10.411 --> 00:00:11.751
<i>In 726, Li Bai looked up at the Moon</i>
公元726年，李白举头望月，

00:00:11.791 --> 00:00:13.130
<i>and wrote about missing home.</i>
写下了对故乡的思念。

00:00:17.776 --> 00:00:19.106
<i>Every space program on Earth</i>
全世界的航天计划

00:00:19.146 --> 00:00:21.189
<i>is building the International Moonbase.</i>
共建国际月球基地。

00:00:31.948 --> 00:00:34.898
The willow in winter is slender,
冬柳身纤细，

00:00:35.422 --> 00:00:38.270
her switches plain and straight;
丝素净笔直；

00:00:38.986 --> 00:00:42.363
the West Lake wind sings over water,
西湖的风掠过水面歌唱，

00:00:42.533 --> 00:00:45.829
like smoothing silk, and late
如抚平丝绸；午后将晚，

00:00:46.155 --> 00:00:49.544
in afternoon teahouses watching
在茶馆里，看着

00:00:49.714 --> 00:00:53.131
snow-brewed tea. That line—
雪水烹茶。那一句——

00:00:53.249 --> 00:00:55.245
举杯邀明月，
I raise my cup to invite the bright moon;

00:00:55.285 --> 00:00:57.109
对影成三人
with my shadow, we make three.

00:00:57.149 --> 00:01:04.010
I think of you — homesick with waning
我想你——思乡，伴着残月

00:01:04.871 --> 00:01:10.389
moons and lonely wine.
与孤独的酒。

00:01:16.463 --> 00:01:20.284
月缺酒寒，
The moon wanes, the wine grows cold —

00:01:20.324 --> 00:01:24.496
我思念你
I miss you.

00:01:25.258 --> 00:01:29.510
I think of you, I think of you
我想你，我想你

00:01:30.887 --> 00:01:33.444
举杯邀明月
I raise my cup to invite the bright moon

00:01:33.484 --> 00:01:38.567
moons and lonely wine
残月与孤酒

00:01:50.283 --> 00:01:53.820
举头望明月，
I raise my head to gaze at the bright moon

00:01:53.860 --> 00:02:00.780
低头思故乡
I lower my head and think of home.

00:03:18.440 --> 00:03:20.320
海上生明月，
<i>The bright moon rises over the sea;</i>

00:03:20.360 --> 00:03:24.210
天涯共此时
<i>however far apart, we share this moment.</i>

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:26.423
<i>For everyone working far from</i>
献给每一位在远方工作、

00:03:26.463 --> 00:03:28.627
<i>the people they love. Look up —</i>
思念家人的人。抬头看看——

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:30.860
<i>they’re looking at the same moon.</i>
他们望着的，是同一轮明月。
